From d6f116a1e8090eeaea4e53a26c8daba6fd582346 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 00:01:24 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Keep Lotus miner-fund validation separate from Avalanche
 parking policy

Lotus already enforces miner funding as consensus and burns half of fees.
The eCash parking policies use different reward accounting and would park
valid mainnet blocks after initial sync. Keep the coordination classes
available while removing their registration in ConnectTip.

Rationale added during metadata recovery; this is not a recovered historical
message. Author and date are retained from the recorded replay commit.
The source diff is unchanged.

Recorded-replay-commit: f197c72f3c4726f714a0bd93f9c8f43c0dbe98e5

